# Simple Timelock Script (P2SH Redeem Script)
# This script locks funds until a specific timestamp/block height
# Can be unlocked by anyone with the private key after the timelock expires

# Redeem Script:
<locktime> OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP <pubkey> OP_CHECKSIG

# To spend, scriptSig must be:
# <signature> <redeem_script>

# Example with specific values:
# Locktime: September 10, 2025 (1757462400 UNIX timestamp)
# PubKey: 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798
1757462400 OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798 OP_CHECKSIG